 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Totally normal. One way to make it easier is to have small talk prepared in advance. Pick a few back channel topics so you' not stuck going through old conversations. Not necessarily a book, though bringing something you enjoy while it' on keeps your evening filled up. Great idea. Have couple of sides, and if you get miso soup instead of water, it's a bit of a treat without being over expensive. Lingering at an Italian is definitely nice. Order one of big pasta dishes so you've got enough for leftovers.",
